<Project>

  <!--
    Analysis is OPT-IN, rule by rule.

    Turning the standard set on wholesale produces about 1,266 warnings here, and
    almost all of it is noise: 636 CA1725 (parameter names differing from an
    interface), 152 CA1861, 112 CA1822. Nobody reads 1,266 warnings, so a build
    that emits them is a build whose warnings mean nothing - which is how the
    real ones hide.

    So AnalysisMode is None and .editorconfig turns on a short list, as ERRORS.
    Every rule on that list was checked against this code before being enabled;
    the ones that sounded alarming and turned out to be false positives are
    written down there rather than left for somebody to rediscover.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest</AnalysisLevel>
    <AnalysisMode>None</AnalysisMode>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
